  dialogues:
  - name: Newspaper
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5ec551a80c80f564a82a6cb6e79b99a5, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - 10 February 2146.
    - Riots continue.
    - Power lost throughout the city.
    - All contact with the centre is lost.
    - E.D.E.N. spokesman found crucified outside the city.
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - The last newspaper published.
    - We all thought that the centre had fallen like the rest of us.
    - But you not only survived but thrived.
  - name: Knut
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0819b2a39ff19584597e14c64d8fbdf0, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "That\u2019s one way to look at it\u2026"
    - "Your mythologizing of my home has caused nothing but problems\u2026"
